    <details class="held"><summary>D. Counsel and money<span class="grp-count">3</span></summary><div class="body"><ul class="chk-list"><li class="chk-item pending"><span class="chk-box"></span><span>Counsel: does our tour marketing need Florida Seller of Travel registration or fit an exemption (559.927, 559.935); also CA, WA, HI, IA.</span></li><li class="chk-item pending"><span class="chk-box"></span><span>CPA: Sean&#39;s LESARUSS travel kept separate from tour revenue.</span></li><li class="chk-item pending"><span class="chk-box"></span><span>Sean: remove &quot;Tax-Deductible Sponsorship&quot; from the Global Tour Google Doc and the Issuu sponsorship deck, and notify any sponsor who received it (the website&#39;s own pages are already correct).</span></li></ul></div></details>
    <details class="held"><summary>E. Tourism bureaus<span class="grp-count">2</span></summary><div class="body"><ul class="chk-list"><li class="chk-item pending"><span class="chk-box"></span><span>South Florida destination package (stays, retreats, restaurants, events).</span></li><li class="chk-item pending"><span class="chk-box"></span><span>Pitch Visit Lauderdale and Greater Miami CVB for FY2028, February to May 2027; ask for a hosted media trip first.</span></li></ul></div></details>
    <details class="held"><summary>F. The pilot<span class="grp-count">2</span></summary><div class="body"><ul class="chk-list"><li class="chk-item pending"><span class="chk-box"></span><span>Choose the region and hotel bases with the operator; price and terms as above; dedicated host named.</span></li><li class="chk-item pending"><span class="chk-box"></span><span>Pilot film plan: one city, two or three local Vegan founders, releases and music cleared.</span></li></ul></div></details>
